SUMMARY:[Lectures and Training] 5th Annual Hematology and Oncology Updates
  for the Advanced Practice Provider
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260918T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260919T120000
DTSTAMP:20260817T105227Z
UID:winship-b0d9dfaa3b2aa944832fb4c2@emory-seminars
DESCRIPTION:Program: Lectures and Training\n\nSpeaker: 5th Annual Hematolo
 gy and Oncology Updates for the Advanced Practice Provider\n\nEvent type: 
 Lectures and Training\n\nHosted by Winship Cancer Institute of Emory Unive
 rsity\, the 5th Annual Hematology and Oncology Updates for the Advanced Pr
 actice Provider is a two-day continuing education program designed to prov
 ide APPs with the latest\, evidence-based strategies to optimize care and 
 outcomes for patients with cancer. Advancing Knowledge. Recognizing Excell
 ence. Building Connections. Our conference is designed to promote learning
 \, expand the knowledge of NPs and PAs\, and support professional growth t
 hrough engaging educational sessions and updates in clinical practice. We 
 proudly recognize the accomplishments and contributions of our APPs throug
 h special awards presentations celebrating excellence within our professio
 n. Beyond the educational experience\, we foster meaningful connections an
 d relationships through networking opportunities\, including our highly an
 ticipated bowling alley event — a favorite among attendees from last yea
 r’s conference. Attendees will also enjoy fun and practical conference g
 iveaways as an added thank-you for being part of our conference experience
 . Dates: Friday\, September 18 (all day) and Saturday\, September 19\, 202
 6 (half day) Credits: This conference is approved for 13 hours of AAPA Cat
 egory 1 CME credits from the AAPA Review Panel. Audience: This conference 
 is designed for advanced practice providers\, including nurse practitioner
 s\, physician assistants\, pharmacists\, nurses and APP students.\n\nSourc
 e: https://apps.winshipcancer.emory.edu/admin/Event/6715/5th-annual-hemato
 logy-and-oncology-updates-for-the-advanced-practice-provider/
LOCATION:Emory Conference Center Hotel 1615 Clifton Road NE Atlanta \, Geo
 rgia 30329
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://apps.winshipcancer.emory.edu/admin/Event/6715/5th-annual-hemat
 ology-and-oncology-updates-for-the-advanced-practice-provider/
END:VEVENT
